{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And when you go to war</b> — an allusion to the war of Gog that is destined to come in the days of the Messiah:" "<b>תבאו מלחמה</b> — in gematria: במלחמת גוג (in the war of Gog):" "<b>תבאו</b> — the letters of אבות (the patriarchs); that the merit of the patriarchs stands in war:" "<b>And you shall sound the trumpets</b> — on account of (Psalms 60:10) \"רוע התרועעה הארץ תרועם בשבט ברזל\" (You have made the earth tremble; You have broken it; with an iron scepter You shatter them):"], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:43.240939090Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}